There is no universal menstrual product that everyone must use. Some people may use one product throughout their period, while others may use different products depending on the day or activity.

The most important factors are comfort, hygiene, correct usage, and personal preference. Learning about different menstrual products allows each person to make an informed choice that works for their lifestyle.
